{"beat": 36, "name": "THE HONEST RANGE", "text": "And even the products that can be measured come with a range, not a point. That -2.76 has an honest interval around it, from -5.87 to 0.35. It crosses zero. At one end, this product is very sensitive to price. At the other, the estimate can't rule out that price doesn't matter at all. The range comes from the standard error, which is how far another run of periods like these could move the slope, times a multiplier that grows as the periods get fewer. A tool that hands you a single number without the range is telling you something it doesn't know.", "provider": "placeholder", "words": [{"word": "And", "start": 0.0, "end": 0.2}, {"word": "even", "start": 0.2, "end": 0.42}, {"word": "the", "start": 0.42, "end": 0.6}, {"word": "products", "start": 0.6, "end": 0.98}, {"word": "that", "start": 0.98, "end": 1.24}, {"word": "can", "start": 1.24, "end": 1.4}, {"word": "be", "start": 1.4, "end": 1.54}, {"word": "measured", "start": 1.54, "end": 1.92}, {"word": "come", "start": 1.92, "end": 2.18}, {"word": "with", "start": 2.18, "end": 2.38}, {"word": "a", "start": 2.38, "end": 2.54}, {"word": "range,", "start": 2.54, "end": 3.0}, {"word": "not", "start": 3.32, "end": 3.54}, {"word": "a", "start": 3.54, "end": 3.76}, {"word": "point.", "start": 3.76, "end": 4.0}, {"word": "That", "start": 4.68, "end": 4.84}, {"word": "-2.76", "start": 4.84, "end": 6.28}, {"word": "has", "start": 6.28, "end": 6.84}, {"word": "an", "start": 6.84, "end": 7.0}, {"word": "honest", "start": 7.0, "end": 7.42}, {"word": "interval", "start": 7.42, "end": 7.92}, {"word": "around", "start": 7.92, "end": 8.34}, {"word": "it,", "start": 8.34, "end": 8.54}, {"word": "from", "start": 8.76, "end": 8.96}, {"word": "-5.87", "start": 8.96, "end": 10.4}, {"word": "to", "start": 10.4, "end": 10.76}, {"word": "0.35.", "start": 10.76, "end": 11.84}, {"word": "It", "start": 12.78, "end": 12.98}, {"word": "crosses", "start": 12.98, "end": 13.34}, {"word": "zero.", "st